window.products.push({"id":520017,"name":"Meeting & Market Nag Champa Candle - Soy Wax Scented Candle - Long Burning Candle for Men or Women - Premium Fragrance Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iC0wzLQWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Soy Wax SCENT NOTES: Nag Champa is an Indian fragrance popular in incense (for those of you who didn't come of age in the 60s and 70s). It has woody notes similar to patchouli, with touches of musk, amber, and vanilla. If you haven't smelled it before, you have to try it. If you know it, we think you'll love this rendition. This fragrance oil is infused with natural essential oils, including patchouli and gurjun balsam. MANUFACTURER: Meeting & Market Soy Wax Candles are based in Charleston, SC. From wicking the glassware to labeling the box, we are still a hands on, hand crafted product. Over the years, we have poured nearly 10,000 candles. We like to think practice makes perfect. BURN TIME: These 16oz candles will burn for a minimum 60 hours. We recommend burning them until completely liquified across the top to avoid tunneling. Take a look at our insert for a few other helpful hints. ECO-FRIENDLY & SOY WAX - This candle is made with naturally biodegradable and eco-friendly soy wax. It is paraben and cruelty free! LONG LASTING, DURABLE, & RECYCLABLE: Our candles have some of the longest burn times on the market. Our heavy duty glassware is extremely tough, and can be recycled for storing cotton balls, Q-tips, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61iC0wzLQWL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Meeting & Market","source_asin":"B01MS45QCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520017","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MS45QCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MS45QCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
