window.products.push({"id":520036,"name":"Euro-Pro EP031 Mini Turbo Shark 400-Watt Hand Vacuum","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411WB13H47L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description The Mini Shark Hand Vacuum from Euro-Pro provides the classic power of the Shark hand vac in a small package. All the features of the original Shark including a bagless dust cup, the Mini Shark boasts 400 watts of power and includes crevice tool, brush and flexible hose accessories. Amazon.com A hand vacuum with weak suction is no more than clutter. Thats why the Euro-Pro Mini Turbo Shark vacuum packs a lot of bite into its diminutive form. With 400 watts of power, the unit delivers a surprising amount of suction, so its a great tool to have on hand in the kitchen, garage, shop, or office. It makes quick work of dry spills and debris and can also be used for dusting in nooks and crannies with the included attachments. One thing to note: 400 watts of power does come at a price, and this hand vacuum is no kitten. The sound is not especially unpleasant--its just loud--but you probably wont be able to crank it on if the baby is sleeping. Easy to manipulate, the vacuum has a comfortable handle and a simple rocker power switch. The bagless dirt collection cup pops off easily for emptying, and the interior filter is washable. Conversion to attachment cleaning is also straightforward--the flexible hose, crevice tool, and brush fit snugly into the Sharks oval mouth. About the size of a youth football, the hand vac measures 8-1/4 inches long, nose to tail, and stands 5-1/2 inches high and 3-3/4 inches wide. It weighs less than two pounds and carries Euro-Pro's one-year warranty. --Emily Bedard","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/411WB13H47L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shark","source_asin":"B0001DA97A","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520036","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0001DA97A","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0001DA97A","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":520037,"name":"HappyStream Preserved Real Rose with Heart Pendant Necklace. Forever Rose Flower for Mom Wife Sister Girlfriend on Mothers Day Birthday Valentines Day","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tsuXRrjQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"💕【100% Real Rose】Preserved roses are made of 100% real natural rose flowers which have gone through state-of-the-art preservation technology and can retain their beauty. The rose is big (approx. 3.2 inch in diameter), nice and elegant, and the petals are tender and delicate. It is beautiful and will never go out of style, perfect to be given as Valentines Day gifts for Her, Mothers Day Gifts for Wife, Birthday Gifts for Women, Christmas gifts for women, or celebration of any day. 💕【No Withering, Easy to Care】The eternal rose will never wither and it is easy to care. Stored properly, the beautiful rose will stay for at least 1-3 years to forever. Convey your forever love and caring to your loved women, family, and friends with this long-lasting gift, as an expression of “I love you”, “I am thinking of you”, ”You are wonderful”, “Thank you”, etc. And she will be happily delighted whenever she looks at it. 💕【Infinity Heart Necklace for Women】 With intertwined symbols of love & eternity, the necklace is a perfect match with forever rose. The stunning design is completed by 28 small glittering 1.5mm CZ stones and 1 large sparkling 5mm CZ stone on the large heart pendant. The chain is adjustable, 18” with a 2” extension, so it will fit every woman. Made from quality brass with exquisite craftsmanship, the necklace is lead-free, nickel-free and causes no harm to health. 💕【Special 5-in-1 Gifts Design】The eternal rose is safely packaged and displayed in a sturdy protective gift box so it will be delivered in perfect condition. The jewelry box features a small drawer itself, where lies the infinity love heart necklace. The drawer can also be used to store other small jewelry like rings, earrings. Along with a card for personalized message and a matching gift handbag, the complete set makes a luxury one-of-a-kind gift for her. 💕【Gifts for Her for Every Occasion】Both eternal rose and infinity heart necklace represent everlasting love, making unique long-lasting Gifts for Mom, Girlfriend, Wife, Daughter, Sister, Best Friends on any special days and occasions like Mother’s Day, Valentine’s Day, Anniversary, Wedding, Engagement, Birthday, Thanksgiving, Christmas, Housewarming, Congratulation, Graduation. Or simply as romantic surprise gifts for her on an ordinary day.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tsuXRrjQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HappyStream","source_asin":"B09FYQVGYX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520037","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09FYQVGYX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09FYQVGYX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
