window.products.push({"id":520163,"name":"Clay Pot For Cooking Ceramic Casserole Clay Pot Terracotta Casserole Pot - High Temperature Firing, Heat Preservation And Energy Saving-Capacity4.5L_P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HZU4AZhEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Name: CasseroleMaterial: CeramicCapacity: 4.5LApplicable number: 3-5★ Tips:1. Ceramic production process is complicated. A small number of products may have bubbles, and small dots and other small defects are normal phenomena and cannot be completely avoided.2. All pictures in this store are taken in kind, and there may be some color difference due to factors such as the display and the light of the shooting scene.3. Because the measurement method is different from the production batch, if the product size is 5mm, the error is within the normal range, please refer to the actual object received.★ About maintenance:1. Cleaning: Please add detergent with warm water and wipe with a sponge or a soft cloth.Newly purchased ceramic tableware can be boiled in salt water for a while, which is not easy to break when used, and can prolong the service life.2. Placement: Pay attention to anti-drop and anti-collision, and place it in a safe and stable space.3. Sanding: Do not use a rough brush or steel ball to avoid scratching the glaze; if you accidentally scratch it, use a toothpaste to polish it slightly.Technical Details:Colour: PinkItem Weight: 3.3 KgCapacity: 4.5 litresMaterial: ceramic","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41HZU4AZhEL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FGJI","source_asin":"B08L56G8RK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520163","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08L56G8RK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08L56G8RK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
