window.products.push({"id":520256,"name":"Peace & Love Hanging Mobile - 14 Inches - High Quality - Handmade in Denmark by Flensted","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":44.5,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zY3g7KNPL._AC_SL1437_.jpg","description":"How can I clean my mobile?Mobiles made of cardboard should only be dusted with a soft brush. Mobiles made of wood, aluminium or plastic can be wiped with a moist cloth with a few drops of mild dishwashing detergent.How long can my Mobile last?One person called us and said that they had inherited a Science Fiction Mobile from her grandmother who had had it for 30 years! In our home we have had the same mobile hanging for more than 20 years.Can my mobile hang outdoors?No. Since they are very sensitive to the simplest whiff of air hanging them outside is not recommendable.Will my mobile fade?In many of our mobiles we use plastic foil. This material is lightproof and easy to clean. Some other mobiles are made of cardboard. Even though we use the highest quality cardboard it will fade over the years. Red colors fade more than blue. You can delay fading by hanging the mobile out of direct sunlight.When hanging your mobile, try it in different places and bear in mind the following suggestions:1. The mobile is designed to be a pleasure to the eye and a stimulus to the imagination. Hang out of reach of children. It is not a toy.2. Hang it away from direct sunlight to avoid the colors fading and the shapes distorting.3. Hang it where there is some movement of air but no strong draft. A slow, quiet movement is the essence of the mobile. Do not hang it outdoors.4. Where practical, hang the mobile where it has a subdued, uniform background. A corner position against light-colored walls is often the best location.5. If possible, hang it in the light from a lamp. The shadow that the mobile casts onto a wall or ceiling will give the mobile yet another dimension. A candle is a concentrated light source which will produce distinct, well-defined shadows.6. Hang the mobile where you can watch it while listening to music. You will see the mobile move to the rhythm of the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51zY3g7KNPL._AC_SL1437_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Flensted Mobiles","source_asin":"B001QABX68","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520256","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B001QABX68","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B001QABX68","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":520257,"name":"SOLEADER Silicone Kitchen Tongs for Cooking 11 Inch Premium Spatula Tongs Set with Stainless Steel Core for BBQ Clamp,Flipping Fish,Fried Steak Clamp,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":13.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CSW-pQPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Multi-Functional: Cooking tongs is bigger than normal size makes it perfect for flipping steaks, fish, burgers, eggs, filets, meat, and other food with ease. You only need one set of silicone kitchen tongs to cook effortlessly without the need to switch between several cooking tongs, it can easily handle grabbing, flipping, and scraping, making it very convenient. They can be a cooking tongs, or salad tongs, grill tongs, toast tongs and more！ Sturdy and Durable: Different from other cooking tongs, SOLEADER silicone tongs for cooking are made with high quality stainless steel core, this kitchen tongs is exceptionally durable and sturdy, and doesn't bend easily. No rust, Non-stick and easy to clean. Safe and Reliable: Spatula tongs and salad tongs surface fully covered with food-grade silicone that is safe to use and won't scratch your non-stick pans or griddles. And the bottom of these tongs has a beveled edge design, very easy to flip the food. Heat-Resistant: With a temperature range of -40 to 446℉, this spatula can be used in the oven, freezer, or dishwasher, and is perfect for grilling and barbecuing. Tips: Please do not put the silicone tongs on an open flame. Practical Design: The slot design of spatula tongs allows excess grease and oil to drain off, making it easy to clean up. The ergonomic handle provides a comfortable and secure grip. The salad tongs have an extended handle with a convex design on the inner side to prevent food from slipping. Anti-hot, non-slip, easy to clip.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61CSW-pQPUL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SOLEADER","source_asin":"B0BYHHJNLX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520257","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BYHHJNLX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BYHHJNLX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":520258,"name":"Tankufudio Cervical Memory Foam Pillow for Neck Pain, Contour Neck Pillows for Pain Relief Sleeping Snoring Orthopedic for Side Ergonomic Bed Pillow w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qsCrJWOaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🛏【Ideal for Better Sleep Quality】Do you suffer from insomnia all night? Are you waking up with neck cramps or back pain? The orthopedic pillow fits the curve of the spine, provides natural proper support to your body and relaxes your muscles, effectively relieving cervical and neck pain. It is soft and comfortable when sleeping. Provides adequate heat distribution, so you can rest without feeling hot or uncomfortable. Creates better air circulation to keep you cool and dry. Your sleep quality has been further improved and wake up relaxed without any neck and shoulder pain. 🔝【Premium & Echo-friendly Material】The core of the cervical neck support pillow is made of high-density memory foam, it has a unique non-toxic, non-allergenic, molded foam design that will provide sleeping firm support with amazing comfort and proper softness. It can slow rebound its shape within a few minutes. In addition, the contour pillow comes with a breathable and skin-friendly pillowcase for easy replacement and cleaning. 🌙【Work with Different Sleeping Styles】Ergonomic design with special butterfly shape, allowing you to shift between positions comfortably. The innovative design allows our ergonomic pillow to naturally fit your curved spine perfectly, providing proper support for spinal alignment,makes you to shift between positions comfortably. No matter you’re a back sleeper, side sleeper or stomach sleeper, the contour pillow will provide firm support to your cervical and head. 👐【Two Heights to Meet Your Need】 Cervical neck pillow size: 25.59\"*15.35\"*3.94\"/5.51\". The choice of height is affected by sleeping posture, personal habits, shoulder width, and weight. Everything is subject to maintaining a normal cervical spine physiological curve. Just Rotate the pillow to enjoy different heights. Back sleepers with cervical issues can sleep on the higher side of the pillow with 2 horns as this side provides better support for the head and cervical, so as to keeps your neck properly aligned with the rest of your body. All the other back/side sleepers can sleep on the lower side. 💝【Breathable & Removable Pillowcase】The Tankufudio side sleeping pillow has a double-layer high-quality pillowcase, which is soft and stretches and contracts well with the pillow core. It is removable, has a zipper and is machine washable. Made from hypoallergenic cotton and polyester, the pillowcase fits perfectly against the skin, and its soft, breathable fabric keeps you cool all night - keeps you from night sweats in comfortable climates, give you the comfortable sleep you've always wanted! This memory foam pillow is a great gift choice for the elders, workers, students, and those who suffer from sleep disorders.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qsCrJWOaL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tankufudio","source_asin":"B09ZPBHJ7F","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520258","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09ZPBHJ7F","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09ZPBHJ7F","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
