window.products.push({"id":520315,"name":"Blue Tree Publishing Speech Articulation QR Codes for two animations Anatomy Poster 24x36inch, Speech Language Pathology - Vowels-fricative Consonants","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ul2e5YhbL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Speech Articulation with QR Codes for two animations poster illustrates mouth anatomy and the structural movements involved in the production of each of the vowels and consonants of American English. Scan the two QR codes and see the vocal folds in action or see the ea vowel come to life and the the articulation happens. The LP (large posters) are printed on glossy plastic in bright, easy-to-see colors. The ink side is laminated to make the poster smear- proof and protect it from dirt and water. Dry-erase pens wipe off clean making the posters great for office, clinic, and classroom. Size: 24\"w, 36\"t","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61Ul2e5YhbL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Blue Tree Publishing","source_asin":"B094YPDY3R","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520315","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094YPDY3R","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094YPDY3R","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":520316,"name":"Styro Pro Decorative Polystyrene Ceiling Planks to Cover Popcorn. #RM-98. Pack of 24 (Covers 43 sq ft). Easy DIY Glue up Application on Any Flat Surfa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817prh3exiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABOUT OUR STYROFOAM CEILING PLANKS Our Polystyrene (Styrofoam) ceiling planks are one of the fastest and easiest ways to cover the popcorn ceilings and enhance any room's decor. All you need to do is glue the ceiling planks directly  over the popcorn. Planks have beveled edges for an easy butt joint installation. Beside popcorn, Styrofoam ceiling planks could be installed over pretty much any flat solid surface (plywood, drywall, concrete etc'). These planks cannot be installed in the t-bar grids ( cannot be used as a suspended ceiling tile). It is also not recommended to use these on the walls (as a wall panel), because the material is pretty soft. ADDITIONAL INFORMATION: - Made out of Styrofoam ( Polystyrene). - Planks are feather lite. Each plank weights ~20 gm. Thickness ~0.17\" (~ 4 mm)  - Each plank is ~100cmX16.67cm, or 39.4\"X6.56\" which is ~ 1.8 sq.ft.  - Pack of 24 planks will cover ~43 sq.ft.  - Planks can be cut with sharp utility knife. INSTALLATION INSTRUCTIONS: Prepare the surface remove loose plaster, paint, wallpaper etc. Prepare the surface remove loose plaster, paint, wallpaper etc. Apply the adhesive on the back of the plank along it's perimeter. Water Based Styro Pro adhesive is recommended. Ceramic wall tile paste adhesive (like or Acryl Pro) can be used as well. Apply the adhesive on the back of the plank along it's perimeter. Water Based Styro Pro adhesive is recommended. Ceramic wall tile paste adhesive (like or Acryl Pro) can be used as well. Install the fist row along the side We recommend to start along the longest wall and work your way to the other side of the room. Alternately starting point could be the most visible corner of the room. The planks have finished beveled edges and are installed by butt joining. Install the fist row along the side We recommend to start along the longest wall and work your way to the other side of the room. Alternately starting point could be the most visible corner of the room. The planks have finished beveled edges and are installed by butt joining. Work your way to the other side Install the planks one row after another (with a \"shift\" on each new row, similar to the way hardwood floors are installed). Work your way to the other side Install the planks one row after another (with a \"shift\" on each new row, similar to the way hardwood floors are installed). If you decide to fill in the joints; use paintable silicone. If you decide to fill in the joints; use paintable silicone. Paint the planks using a thick fluffy roller & a Water Based paint. Paint the planks using a thick fluffy roller & a Water Based paint.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817prh3exiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Styro Pro","source_asin":"B08XZYKZ9Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520316","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08XZYKZ9Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08XZYKZ9Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
