window.products.push({"id":520330,"name":"Ginkgo International Alsace 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Place Setting, Service for 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":88.41,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RjFLV6mTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Product Description Ginkgo has been designing quality since 1977. A perfect example of this is our Ginkgo Alsace 20-Piece Stainless Steel Flatware Set, Service for four. Traditional and classic, the Alsace pattern is an elegant, timeless way to set your table. The design is inspired by 17th century silversmiths and part of the Helmick Collection exclusively available from Ginkgo. This 20-piece place setting includes four each of the following; salad fork, dinner fork, dinner knife, dinner spoon and teaspoon. Made in Korea of 18/0 Stainless Steel. Dishwasher Safe. Ginkgo. Made for your life. Amazon.com Inspired by 17th-century silversmith patterns, Alsace flatware is relatively simple yet timelessly elegant. From very slender necks, the fork and spoon handles flare into softly squared ends, the only embellishment a subtle central rib at the very end. The knife is thicker and completely smooth at the end, and stretches into a gracefully long blade that complements large dinner plates. Crafted of durable 18/10 stainless steel, the flatware pieces exhibit a mirror finish and a gratifyingly heft, and are perfect for everyday or formal dining. Ready to serve two couples or a family of four, this 20-piece starter set consists of four place settings, each of which includes a 9-1/2-inch dinner knife, 7-3/4-inch dinner fork, 7-1/4-inch salad fork, 7-1/8-inch soup spoon, and 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. A larger set and a hostess set are available separately to fully coordinate the table. Priced and designed for everyday use in either a traditional or contemporary setting, Alsace is conveniently dishwasher-safe, although soaking in water and prolonged exposure to acidic foods should be avoided to prevent spotting. A family-owned business since 1977, Ginkgo International is dedicated to quality design and value when it comes to flatware for the home. --Ann Bieri What's in the Box 4 place settings. Each place setting consists of: 9-1/2-inch dinner knife; 7-3/4-inch dinner fork; 7-1/4-inch salad fork; 7-1/8-inch soup spoon; 6-3/8-inch teaspoon. 20 pieces total.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51RjFLV6mTL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Ginkgo","source_asin":"B00VFTH9X6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520330","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00VFTH9X6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00VFTH9X6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
