window.products.push({"id":520428,"name":"Handmade Italian Green Ceramic Basket (5.25” x 4\") | Intrecci Collection by Modigliani – Small, Hand-Painted Ceramic Woven Home Décor Baskets | Perfec","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dsK-mjgtL._AC_.jpg","description":"INTRECCI BASKET COLLECTION BY MODIGLIANI: Available in multiple colors and sizes, our Intrecci (which means “to weave”) Collection ranges in use from paper clip holder to large, woven planters. This small green, ceramic oval bon bon basket measures just 4.75” in diameter & is handmade by Italian artisans and make the perfect decorative bowl to keep jewelry in or office supplies like paper clips. PERFECT DECORATIVE BASKET FOR THE HOME OR OFFICE: Put on display a beautiful work on handmade Italian craftsmanship to top off any dining room or kitchen table. Our “Bon Bon” basket (which means candy in Italian) is the perfect, small basket that you can used as a candy bowl for the office or office supplies on your desk! Make sure to decorate your table or home with our one-of-a-kind woven, ceramic basket! HANDMADE BY ITALIAN ARTISTS: Each of our ceramic basket are traditionally hand crafted by our skilled artisans in Italy. The Modigliani Intrecci Collection helps you bring the taste of Italian art into your home. Please note, the item you receive will not be the exact same as pictured due to each piece being hand crafted. Each small, ceramic bowl is an original work of art, uniquely hand-made by stay at home mothers who learned the craft from their mom! MIX & MATCH WITH OUR COMPLETE SET: Time to throw away that old fine China! Finally, decorative kitchen or office décor that you’ll be proud to use year round. Makes for the perfect gift for teachers or office assistants or like putting out treats. This Intrecci collection is sold separately and features multiple color options of Octagon, Oval & Square Woven, Ceramic Baskets, along with Ceramic Planters. SUPPORT TRADITION: Modigliani Italian ceramics strongly supports the tradition of passing down art from past four generation. All set pieces in this authentic ceramic fruit basket & planters collection were made by Italian artists that have learned classic ways of creating beautiful, functional art. Collect a piece of Italy and indulge your eyes with a natural basket set that is made to last and support the timeless tradition of handmade ceramics.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51dsK-mjgtL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Modigliani","source_asin":"B00Y9GPUPG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520428","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00Y9GPUPG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00Y9GPUPG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":520429,"name":"SUAKY Zebra Roller Sheer Shades Blinds, Black Custom Free Stop Dual Layer Window Shades with Valance, Sheer or Privacy Light Control, Day and Night Bl","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715j8FlUUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MOUNT TYPES: Inside mounted shades will have a deduction taken of approximately 0.2\" to ensure a proper fit inside the window frame.Inside mounted shades require a minimum frame depth of 2inch for secure installation. If your window frame depth is less than 2inch please select outside mount.Outside mounted shades should be ordered with the exact width of the area you wish to cover. Outside mounts are often used when there is not sufficient frame depth for inside mounting.Our shades come with all mounting hardware, and mounting hardware for both inside mount and outside mount INSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the inside frame width at three locations-the top,middle,and bottom. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use that number as your inside width when ordering. Step 2. Measure the height at 3 locations-the left,middle,and right side. Record the smallest of the 3 measurements and use the number as your inside width when ordering. OUTSIDE MOUNT MEASUREMENT: Step 1. Measure the outside frame width adding 3-6inch to be the outside mount width. Step 2. Measure the outside frame length adding 4-6inch to be the outside mount length. The overlap it recommended to allow appropriate coverage and avoid any light gaps. Type: Zebra Blinds Feature: Block Light & UV, Keep Warm Material: Polyester Installation: All Mounting Hardware Included.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/715j8FlUUnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SUAKY","source_asin":"B0BGS6K8QV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520429","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BGS6K8QV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BGS6K8QV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
