window.products.push({"id":520510,"name":"AOZITA 70th Birthday Gifts for Women and Men - 15oz Wine Glass - 70th Birthday Decorations for Women - 70th Anniversary Ideas for Her, Mom, Dad, Husba","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HdNNPL0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"★A CLASSY AND TIMELESS GIFT FOR HER / HIM - When you are looking to buy something for someone who has everything, this is the gift that fits right in and makes a big hit. An unique personalized milestone wine glass is the perfect present for the 70th birthday, seventy wedding anniversary celebration or class reunion. They can use for many years in daily life, will not fade and lose its glory in a forever imprint reads 'VINTAGE 1951 AGED TO PERFECTION' ★VINTAGE, BEAUTIFUL AND ERGONOMIC DESIGN - Don't buy gifts for your loved ones that have 70th or 70 printed on them. They are common, lack of creativity and novelty, will be out of date next year. The exquisite teardrop shape of the 15 oz stemless wine glass offers excellent clarity for showcasing various drinks - red or white wine, champagne, cocktails, cabernet, pinot noir and rose wines. Besides, they will fell in love with it as ergonomic shape creates a effortless feel in hand ★GREAT GIFT FUN PARTY FAVORS AND DECORATIONS - This novel and delicate wine glass will win WOW praise from all guests, whether it's a 70th birthday party, class reunion or a 70th anniversary. Everyone will be thrilled to drink their favorite wine in this limited edition landmark wine glasses. Buy them as a set of 2, 4, 6, 12 or even more to make the milestone event be truly memorable and unique ★A LIFETIME GIFT AND BLESSING - The most valuable aspect of a gift is that it is not only be loved, but also accompany her in daily use of lifetime. Imagine how happy and touched your lover, parents or friends will be when they open this delicate package and see this wine glass with the date of their birth, wedding anniversary, or the year you met. Your family love and friendships will last a lifetime just like this timeless glass ★100% LOVE IT BDAY PRESENT - We will send it to you a delicate package as a gift. We firmly believe that this delicate crafted wine glass will be loved by everyone at first sight.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71HdNNPL0ZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"AOZITA","source_asin":"B07LF241BV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LF241BV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LF241BV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":520511,"name":"Premium 100% Waterproof King Size Mattress Protector Cooling Tech Bamboo Mattress Cover Noiseless Soft Breathable Mattress Pad Fitted Style 8\"-21\" Dee","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.9,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W6L9HpWTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"100% WATERPROOF & NOISELESS: MERITLIFE mattress protector is Standard 100 by OEKO-TEX certified for meeting the highest testing criteria for harmful chemicals and has been found harmless for humans. Back of our mattress protector cover is top TPU, an invisible waterproof barrier to protect your expensive mattress.They effectively repels all liquids, including accidental spills, bodily fluids like sweat or urine, thus making a clean,healthy sleeping environment.Our mattress Protectors are silent and will not make plastic sound. COOLING & BREATHABLE BAMBOO:Made of Eco-friendly & Natural Bamboo,the combination with polyester creates an Ultra Soft fabric with moisture wicking function. Adopting new cooling Tech. our Mattress Protectors are relatively more cooling,softer than cotton terry ones. NEW UPGRADED 3D AIR FABRIC: The fillings of Meritlife Mattress Protector surface is 3D Air Fabric, which only allows air in, but repel liquids.There won’t be any crinkling or plastic sounds when you move. 18 INCH POCKET FITS NICELY:All size fit up to 8\"-21\" mattress ,18 inch deep pocket is designed for all types of mattresses including memory foam, latex or spring.The highly elastic skirt is made of mesh fabric and has excellent ductility to accommodate mattress of various thicknesses to prevent the mattress from moving. CUSTOMER SERVICE & WASHING INSTRUCTION: We provide 30-day Return/Replacement Service.If you are not satisfied FOR ANY REASON, Pls contact our Customer Support and we will do everything to make you 100% satisfied. ❤️Machine wash cold separately on GENTLE/DELICATE cycle.Tumble dry on low.Do not bleach.Do not dry clean.We suggest you buy 2 pieces or more, so you can change one while wash the other.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W6L9HpWTL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MERITLIFE","source_asin":"B0859BY9XJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520511","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0859BY9XJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0859BY9XJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
