window.products.push({"id":520663,"name":"Tametra Cooling Blanket for Hot Sleepers, Twin Size Summer Blankets with Double Sided Cold Effect for Bed Lightweight Breathable Oversized Cold Blanke","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":26.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W6vsfn1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【DOUBLE SIDED COOLING EFFECT TECHNOLOGY】 - Our cold blanket for sleeping is a double-sided cooling comforter with a cooling value of over 0.441, which provides a strong cooling sensation that other blankets cannot provide. Double-sided cooling technology speeds up the removal of sweat and heat from the surface of the body, while reducing the internal temperature of the body by about 2℃. A best cooling blanket that will keep you cool and dry all night long in the summer heat. 【USING JAPANESE COLD FIBER】- Our cooling blanket is made of mica nylon and Japanese cold fiber to ensure its superior coolness and comfort, making it an excellent choice for creating a cool and dry summer home experience. Whether for daily or sleep use, our body cooling blanket can greatly improve the comfort index of summer life. Cool blanket hot sleeper can accelerate heat absorption and perspiration on the body surface. 【BREATHABLE AND LIGHTWEIGHT - ULTIMATE SOLUTION FOR KEEPING COOL AND DRY IN SUMMER】 - Because of innovative cooling technology, our cooling blankets have larger cooling pores to eliminate the problem of moisture retention after heat absorption, so you won't wake up feeling uncomfortable due to stickiness or dampness, even after long use of this cooling bed sheets in hot weather. 【EQUIPPED WITH A LAUNDRY BAG TO PROTECT YOUR COOLING BLANKET】 - We provide a laundry bag for each blanket to be used with your machine wash, offering a convenient and effective way to wash the blanket other than by hand. The bag provides good protection for the blanket by preventing snagging and scratching during machine washing. 【MULTIPLE SIZE AND COLOR OPTIONS】 - We offer four sizes of this summer blankets based on standard size graph to meet your purchasing needs for different sizes. From throw XL to King to Cal King blanket, you can find your desired size in order. We offer a wide variety of colors with marble pattern or light and dark stripe. They are dark gray, light gray, blue and beige, any of them can match perfectly with your bedding.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71W6vsfn1HL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tametra Home Bedding","source_asin":"B09TQSR5Y5","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520663","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09TQSR5Y5","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09TQSR5Y5","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
