window.products.push({"id":520682,"name":"moomass 3 Bunches of Artificial Sunflowers, Silk Sun Bouquets Fake Yellow Flower, 7 Flowers per Bunch, a Total of 21 Large Flowers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pZb3pwWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Each flower in each bunch gives a true, natural appearance of flowers. Artificial flowers are a practical alternative to actual floral art, and will remain fresh and beautiful year after year! Add more color and vitality to your life and make you feel happy every day Product parameters: Name: Big Head Sunflower Material: Juan cloth Size: The overall height is about 13 inches, and the flower diameter is about 4 inches. Features: each bouquet has 7 branches, 7 large flowers (3 layers of petals), artificial fuzz core Technology and precautions: 1. The material of the artificial flower is very flexible, and the length of the flower rod can be adjusted according to the requirements: short: it can be directly bent and pruned; need long: it can be grafted. When placing the flower, you can add newspapers to the non-transparent flower to increase the height; the transparent flower can use stones and other decorations. 2. For artificial flower packaging, plastic bags are generally used to wrap the flower head, and try to keep the original shape. When packing, sometimes it is necessary to bend the flower branch, and after receiving the goods, the bending part can be flattened back to the original state. 3. The production of artificial flowers is divided into many processes, in which the petal combination is manual. During the transportation process, the flower heads and leaves may appear; this phenomenon is more common, and only the flower heads / leaves can be inserted after receiving the goods. If possible, it can be fixed with hot melt adhesive. 4. The simulated flowers are inevitably squeezed and deformed during transportation. Generally, the bouquets will be restored after a little arrangement. 5. Please do not expose artificial flowers to sunlight and water for a long time","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71pZb3pwWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"moomass","source_asin":"B0894LHKF9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520682","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0894LHKF9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0894LHKF9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
