window.products.push({"id":520715,"name":"ShalinIndia Copper Water Goblet - 350mL Drinking Glass - Ayurvedic Healing Benefits - Artisan Crafted in India","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BZl60dh0L._AC_SL1144_.jpg","description":"In India, it's customary to drink water from a glass made out of copper. Not only are copper drinking glasses pleasing to the eye, but they have healing properties and have long been recommended by practitioners of Ayurveda. With the ShalinIndia Copper Water Goblet, you can continue the tradition of sipping water from copper vessels and reap the Ayurvedic health benefits that copper provides. The ShalinIndia Copper Water Goblet is a stunning drinking glass that is sure to impress guests at any get-together. The goblet features a large bowl with a wide brim and a tapered body that is pleasing to the eye. Large enough to hold 350 milliliters of water, the bowl has been hammered outside to give it a lustrous appearance. The bowl is positioned on an engraved stem fashioned out of brass with a beautiful yellow gold color. Overall, the water goblet is 6 inches tall by 3 inches in diameter, and it weights 225 grams. Handmade in Muradabad, India, the ShalinIndia Copper Water Goblet is constructed the traditional way just like the water goblets that have been used in India for centuries. The bowls of the goblets are 100 percent pure copper, giving you the most healing benefits possible. For best results, allow water to rest in the goblet over night or store water over night in one of our copper water jugs before serving it in the goblet. Enjoy the health benefits of Ayurveda and the aesthetic appeal of a truly beautiful drinking glass at the same time! Order the ShalinIndia Copper Water Goblet now.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51BZl60dh0L._AC_SL1144_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shalinindia","source_asin":"B01ENEL6ME","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-520715","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01ENEL6ME","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01ENEL6ME","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
